{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "flowId": "51af7ef8-5805-46d1-8473-496306efafb7",
  "name": "BCP - Server -\u003E Server",
  "description": "per-table auto-create-if-missing \r\n(Generate DDL \u2192 Create Table \u2192 ALTER SCHEMA ... TRANSFER, with the dbo-default-schema assumption called out explicitly), \r\n\r\nthe truncate-before-load behavior, why native format demands exact ANSI/Unicode and spatial-type fidelity, -E for identity preservation, and the explicit caveat that indexes/constraints/triggers aren\u0027t recreated. \r\n\r\nAnyone opening this flow (Workflow \u25B8 Description) now gets the reasoning without asking again.",
